      "portrait_expression": "determined",
      "setting_description": "Tala's Cookstall - after dinner",
      "prompt": "Dinner is prepared. They eat together in silence that feels less hostile than before. Then her mother begins speaking about the old days, her voice taking on that sentimental tone that always made Tala defensive.",
