      "display_name": "Tala's Mother",
      "portrait_expression": "sad",
      "setting_description": "Tala's Cookstall - silence follows",
      "prompt": "The conversation falters. Her mother's expression tightens with pain. Tala feels the impulse to leave, to end this before it fractures further. Then, her mother does something unexpected.",
